# Secrets do NOT go here. Every password (sa, CENTRALE_API_KEY,
# CLIENT_SESSION_SECRET, HUB_OTP_SECRET, Twilio) lives in the single repo-root
# /.env file (gitignored); on the server that file is /opt/agrolav/.env.
# See documentation/passwords.md.
#
# Below are the NON-secret, machine-local settings for the hub. Copy to
# hub/.env (gitignored). Everything here is safe to commit conceptually but is
# machine-specific, so it stays untracked.

# Scratch-root for on-disk JSON when SQL is not configured.
# AGROLAV_SQL_DISK=C:/SQLBackups

# Development machine: browser, client and hub share this host, so there is no
# public egress IP. Skips the country/center IP gate for loopback callers and
# writes nothing to dbo.visitor_ip. Never set this on the server.
# HUB_DEV_LOGIN=1